<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
<title>PXID 品向智造 | 小件设计·打样·制造·生产一站式服务平台</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --gold:#FEDB00; --gold-d:#E6C400;
    --ink:#232626; --ink-2:#3c4141; --ink-3:#6b7171;
    --line:rgba(35,38,38,.10); --bg:#fff; --bg-2:#f6f7f5; --bg-3:#f0f1ee;
    --maxw:1280px;
    --sans:'Noto Sans SC','PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei','Source Han Sans CN',system-ui,sans-serif;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
  body{font-family:var(--sans);color:var(--ink);background:var(--bg);line-height:1.6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
  img{display:block;max-width:100%}
  .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px}
  .eyebrow{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-3);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-weight:600}
  .eyebrow::before{content:"";width:28px;height:2px;background:var(--gold)}
  .eyebrow .en{color:var(--gold-d);font-weight:700}
  h2.sec{font-size:clamp(28px,3.4vw,46px);line-height:1.12;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:14px 0 14px}
  .sec-sub{color:var(--ink-2);max-width:760px;font-size:15.5px}
  .gold{color:var(--gold-d)}
  .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:13px 26px;border-radius:2px;font-weight:700;font-size:14.5px;letter-spacing:.02em;transition:.25s;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid transparent}
  .btn-gold{background:var(--gold);color:#1b1b1b}
  .btn-gold:hover{background:var(--gold-d)}
  .btn-line{border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);color:#fff}
  .btn-line:hover{border-color:#fff;background:rgba(255,255,255,.12)}
  .btn-dark{border-color:var(--ink);color:var(--ink)}
  .btn-dark:hover{background:var(--ink);color:#fff}

  /* ===== Header ===== */
  header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:rgba(255,255,255,.96);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:74px}
  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-weight:800;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:.04em}
  .brand .mk{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--ink);color:var(--gold);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:900;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.02em}
  .brand small{display:block;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--ink-3);font-weight:600}
  .menu{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:30px}
  .menu a{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);position:relative;padding:6px 0}
  .menu a::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;bottom:0;width:0;height:2px;background:var(--gold);transition:.25s}
  .menu a:hover::after{width:100%}
  .nav-right{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px}
  .lang{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-3);font-weight:600}
  .lang b{color:var(--ink)}

  /* ===== Hero ===== */
  .hero{position:relative;height:88vh;min-height:560px;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden}
  .hero .bg{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
  .hero::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(100deg,rgba(12,14,16,.86) 0%,rgba(12,14,16,.55) 45%,rgba(12,14,16,.25) 100%)}
  .hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:2;width:100%}
  .hero .eyebrow{color:rgba(255,255,255,.8)}
  .hero .eyebrow::before{background:var(--gold)}
  .hero h1{font-size:clamp(42px,6.6vw,92px);line-height:.98;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:18px 0 6px}
  .hero .en{font-size:clamp(13px,1.4vw,17px);letter-spacing:.28em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);font-weight:700}
  .hero p.lead{margin:22px 0 30px;max-width:620px;font-size:17px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.86);line-height:1.7}
  .hero .acts{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .scroll{position:absolute;left:28px;bottom:26px;z-index:2;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.3em;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
  .scroll .ln{width:1px;height:42px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.5)}

  /* ===== generic section ===== */
  section{padding:88px 0}
  .sec-head{margin-bottom:42px}

  /* ===== About lead ===== */
  .about{background:var(--bg-2)}
  .about .lead2{font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,34px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.25;max-width:900px;letter-spacing:-.01em}
  .about .lead2 .gold{color:var(--gold-d)}
  .about p.body{margin-top:20px;max-width:820px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:16px}

  /* ===== Data strip ===== */
  .strip{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;padding:54px 0}
  .strip .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:0}
  .strip .s{padding:8px 24px 8px 0;border-right:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14)}
  .strip .s:last-child{border-right:none}
  .strip .s b{display:block;font-size:clamp(30px,3.4vw,46px);font-weight:800;color:var(--gold);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.02em}
  .strip .s b .u{font-size:.5em;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);font-weight:700;margin-left:4px}
  .strip .s span{display:block;margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);letter-spacing:.04em}

  /* ===== Process steps ===== */
  .steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:22px}
  .step{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:.25s}
  .step:hover{box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(35,38,38,.10);border-color:transparent;transform:translateY(-4px)}
  .step .ph{height:170px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg-3)}
  .step .ph img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:.5s}
  .step:hover .ph img{transform:scale(1.05)}
  .step .bd{padding:20px}
  .step .bd .no{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--gold-d);font-weight:800}
  .step .bd h3{font-size:18px;margin:6px 0 8px;font-weight:800}
  .step .bd p{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.6}

  /* ===== Cards (capabilities / services / barriers) ===== */
  .cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:22px}
  .card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;transition:.28s;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 18px 40px rgba(35,38,38,.12);border-color:transparent}
  .card .ph{height:190px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg-3)}
  .card .ph img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:.5s}
  .card:hover .ph img{transform:scale(1.06)}
  .card .bd{padding:22px;flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
  .card .bd .idx{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--gold-d);font-weight:800}
  .card .bd h3{font-size:21px;margin:8px 0 4px;font-weight:800}
  .card .bd h3 small{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;display:block;margin-top:2px}
  .card .bd p{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-2);margin:10px 0 14px}
  .card .bd ul{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-top:auto}
  .card .bd li{font-size:11.5px;background:var(--bg-2);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:5px 9px;border-radius:3px;color:var(--ink-2)}

  /* ===== Small-batch ===== */
  .small .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:40px;align-items:center}
  .small .list{list-style:none;margin-top:22px;display:grid;gap:16px}
  .small .list li{position:relative;padding-left:24px;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.6}
  .small .list li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:9px;width:9px;height:9px;background:var(--gold);border-radius:2px}
  .small .list li b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:800}
  .small .ph{border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;height:420px}
  .small .ph img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}

  /* ===== Platform cards ===== */
  .plat{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:22px}
  .pcard{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;padding:26px;background:#fff;transition:.25s;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
  .pcard:hover{border-color:var(--gold);background:var(--bg-2)}
  .pcard .no{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--gold-d);font-weight:800}
  .pcard h3{font-size:19px;margin:8px 0 8px;font-weight:800}
  .pcard p{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.6;flex:1}
  .pcard a.more{margin-top:14px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}
  .pcard a.more:hover{color:var(--gold-d)}

  /* ===== Quality dashboard ===== */
  .quality{background:var(--bg-2)}
  .qstats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .qstats .q{padding:32px 24px;border-right:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .qstats .q:nth-child(3n){border-right:none}
  .qstats .q b{display:block;font-size:clamp(30px,3.2vw,44px);font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.02em}
  .qstats .q b .u{font-size:.45em;color:var(--ink-3);font-weight:700;margin-left:3px}
  .qstats .q h4{font-size:15px;font-weight:800;margin:12px 0 6px}
  .qstats .q p{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55}

  /* ===== Partners ===== */
  .partners .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);gap:14px}
  .partners .b{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;padding:22px 10px;text-align:center;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;transition:.25s}
  .partners .b:hover{border-color:var(--gold);background:var(--bg-2);color:var(--gold-d)}

  /* ===== Cases ===== */
  .cases{background:var(--bg-2)}
  .case-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:22px}
  .case{position:relative;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;height:380px;color:#fff}
  .case img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:.6s}
  .case::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(12,14,16,.05) 30%,rgba(12,14,16,.9) 100%)}
  .case:hover img{transform:scale(1.05)}
  .case .ct{position:absolute;left:22px;right:22px;bottom:22px;z-index:2}
  .case .ct .tag{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--gold);font-weight:800}
  .case .ct h3{font-size:22px;margin:8px 0 8px;font-weight:800}
  .case .ct p{font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.82)}

  /* ===== FAQ ===== */
  .faq .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px 28px}
  .faq details{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;padding:0 20px;background:#fff}
  .faq details summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;padding:18px 0;font-weight:800;font-size:15.5px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:14px}
  .faq details summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
  .faq details summary::after{content:"+";color:var(--gold-d);font-size:22px;font-weight:800}
  .faq details[open] summary::after{content:"\2013"}
  .faq details p{padding:0 0 18px;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.7}

  /* ===== CTA ===== */
  .cta{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:84px 0}
  .cta h2{color:#fff;font-size:clamp(28px,3.6vw,46px);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:14px}
  .cta p{max-width:620px;margin:0 auto 28px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.78);font-size:16px}
  .cta .acts{display:flex;gap:14px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .cta .btn-gold{background:var(--gold);color:#1b1b1b}
  .cta .btn-line{border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);color:#fff}

  /* ===== Footer ===== */
  footer{background:#15191a;color:#fff;padding:64px 0 30px}
  .fgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.6fr 1fr 1fr 1.2fr;gap:36px}
  .fbrand .mk{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--gold);color:#15191a;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:900;font-size:17px;margin-bottom:16px}
  .fbrand b{font-size:18px;font-weight:800}
  .fbrand p{font-size:12.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);margin-top:8px;max-width:300px;line-height:1.6}
  .fcol h5{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:16px;font-weight:800}
  .fcol a,.fcol p{display:block;font-size:13.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.78);margin-bottom:9px}
  .fcol a:hover{color:#fff}
  .fbottom{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);margin-top:46px;padding-top:22px;font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}

  @media(max-width:980px){
    .cards,.case-grid,.steps,.plat,.qstats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
    .strip .grid,.partners .grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
    .small .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .menu{display:none}
    .fgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  }
  @media(max-width:560px){
    .cards,.case-grid,.steps,.plat,.qstats{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .strip .grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
    .partners .grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
    .faq .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .qstats .q{border-right:none}
    .fgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .small .ph{height:300px}
  }

  /* ===== Motion ===== */
  .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px);transition:opacity .7s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1),transform .7s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1);transition-delay:calc(var(--i,0)*70ms)}
  .reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.reveal{opacity:1!important;transform:none!important;transition:none!important}.hero .bg{animation:none}}
  /* hero entrance */
  .hero .eyebrow,.hero h1,.hero .en,.hero p.lead,.hero .acts,.hero .scroll{opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px);transition:opacity .85s ease,transform .85s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1)}
  body.hero-in .hero .eyebrow{transition-delay:.05s}
  body.hero-in .hero h1{transition-delay:.20s}
  body.hero-in .hero .en{transition-delay:.36s}
  body.hero-in .hero p.lead{transition-delay:.48s}
  body.hero-in .hero .acts{transition-delay:.60s}
  body.hero-in .hero .scroll{transition-delay:.74s}
  body.hero-in .hero .eyebrow,body.hero-in .hero h1,body.hero-in .hero .en,body.hero-in .hero p.lead,body.hero-in .hero .acts,body.hero-in .hero .scroll{opacity:1;transform:none}
  /* hero slow zoom */
  @keyframes kb{from{transform:scale(1.04)}to{transform:scale(1.14)}}
  /* header on scroll */
  header.scrolled{box-shadow:0 6px 22px rgba(35,38,38,.10)}
  /* back to top */
  .to-top{position:fixed;right:26px;bottom:26px;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ink);color:var(--gold);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity .3s,transform .3s,background .25s,color .25s;z-index:60;box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.22)}
  .to-top.show{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:none}
  .to-top:hover{background:var(--gold);color:#1b1b1b}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ===== Header ===== -->
<header>
  <div class="wrap nav">
    <a class="brand" href="#top">
      <span class="mk">PX</span>
      <span>PXID<small>品向智造</small></span>
    </a>
    <nav class="menu">
      <a href="#services">核心服务</a>
      <a href="#process">服务流程</a>
      <a href="#small-batch">小单试产</a>
      <a href="#platform">数字化平台</a>
      <a href="#cases">成功案例</a>
      <a href="#faq">常见问题</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="nav-right">
      <span class="lang"><b>中文</b> / EN</span>
      <a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">获取报价</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ===== Hero ===== -->
<section class="hero" id="top">
  <video class="bg" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="assets/pxid2/svc-03.jpg">
    <source src="assets/pxid2/odm-process.mp4" type="video/mp4">
  </video>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">PXID · 一站式智造平台 <span class="en">| 品向智造</span></div>
    <h1>从设计图纸<br>到 批量交付</h1>
    <div class="en">ONE-STOP SMART MANUFACTURING PLATFORM</div>
    <p class="lead">产品设计、快速打样、精密模具、批量生产——全流程自有工厂把控，数字化平台实时追踪，让每一个创意高效落地。</p>
    <div class="acts">
      <a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">立即获取报价 →</a>
      <a class="btn btn-line" href="#process">了解服务流程</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="scroll"><span class="ln"></span>SCROLL ↓</div>
</section>

<!-- ===== About lead ===== -->
<section class="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">关于品向 <span class="en">/ ABOUT PXID</span></div>
    <div class="lead2">源自 PXID，专注 <span class="gold">小件精密制造</span></div>
    <p class="body">专注小件产品设计、快速打样、精密制造与批量生产。用数字化平台和一站式制造能力，让创新落地更简单。</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== Data strip ===== -->
<section class="strip">
  <div class="wrap grid">
    <div class="s"><b>15<span class="u">+</span></b><span>年制造经验 YEARS</span></div>
    <div class="s"><b>10,000<span class="u">+</span></b><span>零件制造数量 PARTS</span></div>
    <div class="s"><b>98<span class="u">%</span></b><span>按时交付率 ON-TIME</span></div>
    <div class="s"><b>500<span class="u">+</span></b><span>服务客户 CLIENTS</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== Process ===== -->
<section id="process">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div class="eyebrow">服务流程 <span class="en">/ PROCESS</span></div>
      <h2 class="sec">从概念到量产 九步一站式交付</h2>
      <p class="sec-sub">自有设计团队与制造工厂深度协同，覆盖产品全生命周期，每一步都清晰可见、可控可溯。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step"><div class="ph"><img src="assets/pxid2/process-01.jpg" alt="产品概念设计"></div><div class="bd"><div class="no">01</div><h3>产品概念设计</h3><p>从手绘草图到3D渲染，将创意转化为可视化设计方案，多轮迭代直至确定最优方向。</p></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="ph"><img src="assets/pxid2/process-02.jpg" alt="结构工程设计"></div><div class="bd"><div class="no">02</div><h3>结构工程设计</h3><p>将设计方案转化为可生产的零部件结构，充分考虑材料选型、成本控制与加工工艺。</p></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="ph"><img src="assets/pxid2/process-03.jpg" alt="电控系统开发"></div><div class="bd"><div class="no">03</div><h3>电控系统开发</h3><p>电池管理、驱动控制、传感集成到智能互联功能，提供完整的电子电气解决方案。</p></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="ph"><img src="assets/pxid2/process-04.jpg" alt="快速原型打样"></div><div class="bd"><div class="no">04</div><h3>快速原型打样</h3><p>CNC加工、3D打印、硅胶复模等快速成型工艺，7-15天内交付可测试的功能样件。</p></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="ph"><img src="assets/pxid2/process-05.jpg" alt="模具设计制造"></div><div class="bd"><div class="no">05</div><h3>模具设计制造</h3><p>自主模具车间，进口高精度加工设备，从模具设计到EDM放电，全流程自主可控。</p></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="ph"><img src="assets/pxid2/process-06.jpg" alt="精密注塑成型"></div><div class="bd"><div class="no">06</div><h3>精密注塑成型</h3><p>近70台精密注塑机，涵盖单色、双色、嵌件注塑，满足小批量试产到大规模量产全阶段需求。</p></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="ph"><img src="assets/pxid2/process-07.jpg" alt="表面处理工艺"></div><div class="bd"><div class="no">07</div><h3>表面处理工艺</h3><p>喷涂、电镀、镭雕、丝印、阳极氧化等完整表面处理线，实现产品高颜值与耐用性。</p></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="ph"><img src="assets/pxid2/process-08.jpg" alt="质量检测验证"></div><div class="bd"><div class="no">08</div><h3>质量检测验证</h3><p>三坐标测量仪、X光检测等先进设备，执行20+项性能测试，确保出厂零缺陷。</p></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="ph"><img src="assets/pxid2/process-09.jpg" alt="批量生产交付"></div><div class="bd"><div class="no">09</div><h3>批量生产交付</h3><p>三条半自动装配线，ISO9001质量体系认证，支持柔性生产，全球物流直达。</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

